    h2 Macros§
    row
      link assert macro.assert.html
      text Asserts that a boolean expression is true at runtime.
      link assert_eq macro.assert_eq.html
      text Asserts that two expressions are equal to each other (using ).
      link PartialEq cmp/trait.PartialEq.html
      link assert_matches macro.assert_matches.html
      text Asserts that an expression matches the provided pattern.
      link assert_ne macro.assert_ne.html
      text Asserts that two expressions are not equal to each other (using ).
      link PartialEq cmp/trait.PartialEq.html
      link cfg macro.cfg.html
      text Evaluates boolean combinations of configuration flags at compile-time.
      link cfg_select macro.cfg_select.html
      text Selects code at compile-time based on cfg predicates.
      link column macro.column.html
      text Expands to the column number at which it was invoked.
      link compile_error macro.compile_error.html
      text Causes compilation to fail with the given error message when encountered.
      link concat macro.concat.html
      text Concatenates literals into a static string slice.
      link debug_assert macro.debug_assert.html
      text Asserts that a boolean expression is true at runtime.
      link debug_assert_eq macro.debug_assert_eq.html
      text Asserts that two expressions are equal to each other.
      link debug_assert_matches macro.debug_assert_matches.html
      text Asserts that an expression matches the provided pattern.
      link debug_assert_ne macro.debug_assert_ne.html
      text Asserts that two expressions are not equal to each other.
      link env macro.env.html
      text Inspects an environment variable at compile time.
      link file macro.file.html
      text Expands to the file name in which it was invoked.
      link format_args macro.format_args.html
      text Constructs parameters for the other string-formatting macros.
      link include macro.include.html
      text Parses a file as an expression or an item according to the context.
      link include_bytes macro.include_bytes.html
      text Includes a file as a reference to a byte array.
      link include_str macro.include_str.html
      text Includes a UTF-8 encoded file as a string.
      link line macro.line.html
      text Expands to the line number on which it was invoked.
      link matches macro.matches.html
      text Returns whether the given expression matches the provided pattern.
      link module_path macro.module_path.html
      text Expands to a string that represents the current module path.
      link option_env macro.option_env.html
      text Optionally inspects an environment variable at compile time.
      link panic macro.panic.html
      text Panics the current thread.
      link stringify macro.stringify.html
      text Stringifies its arguments.
      link todo macro.todo.html
      text Indicates unfinished code.
